  },
  {
    "id": "p1_txt_22",
    "source_text": "本交流活動では、国立モンゴル医科大学と慢性腎不全に対する治療、特に血液透析治療の向上を目指した",
    "source_language": "ja",
    "target_language": "vi",
    "content_type": "body",
    "context": "Page 1 PARAGRAPH",
    "location": {
      "page": 1,
      "bbox": [
        55.68000030517578,
        408.8525085449219,
        549.5996704101562,
        419.41253662109375
      ]
    },
    "protected_tokens": [],
    "translated_text": "",
    "metadata": {},
    "source_block_id": "p1_txt_22",
    "parent_id": null,
    "child_ids": [],
    "role": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "p1_txt_23",
    "source_text": "共同研究を実施する。モンゴルは、人口345万人（2023年）、一人当たりGDP5,700ドル（2023年）の下位中所",
    "source_language": "ja",
    "target_language": "vi",
    "content_type": "body",
    "context": "Page 1 PARAGRAPH",
    "location": {
      "page": 1,
      "bbox": [
        45.119998931884766,
        422.9337463378906,
        550.3399658203125,
        437.1580505371094
      ]
    },
    "protected_tokens": [],
    "translated_text": "",
    "metadata": {},
    "source_block_id": "p1_txt_23",
    "parent_id": null,
    "child_ids": [],
    "role": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "p1_txt_24",
    "source_text": "得国ではあるが、現在、透析施設が約50施設、患者数も約1,200人に増加しているが、人口100万人あたり350",
    "source_language": "ja",
    "target_language": "vi",
    "content_type": "body",
    "context": "Page 1 PARAGRAPH",
    "location": {
      "page": 1,
      "bbox": [
        45.13055419921875,
        439.0166320800781,
        550.2258911132812,
        453.2409362792969
      ]
    },
    "protected_tokens": [],
    "translated_text": "",
    "metadata": {},
    "source_block_id": "p1_txt_24",
    "parent_id": null,
    "child_ids": [],
    "role": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "p1_txt_25",
    "source_text": "人程度（日本は2700人）であり、治療にアクセスできていない患者も多い。2022年にJICAの支援により、モ",
    "source_language": "ja",
    "target_language": "vi",
    "content_type": "body",
    "context": "Page 1 PARAGRAPH",
    "location": {
      "page": 1,
      "bbox": [
        45.14111328125,
        454.9728088378906,
        550.33642578125,
        469.1971130371094
      ]
    },
    "protected_tokens": [],
    "translated_text": "",
    "metadata": {},
    "source_block_id": "p1_txt_25",
    "parent_id": null,
    "child_ids": [],
    "role": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "p1_txt_26",
    "source_text": "ンゴル唯一の国立の医科大学である国立モンゴル医科大学（Mongolian National University of Medical",
    "source_language": "ja",
    "target_language": "vi",
    "content_type": "body",
    "context": "Page 1 PARAGRAPH",
    "location": {
      "page": 1,
      "bbox": [
        45.123809814453125,
        470.76861572265625,
        520.919677734375,
        485.3836669921875
      ]
    },
    "protected_tokens": [],
    "translated_text": "",
    "metadata": {},
    "source_block_id": "p1_txt_26",
    "parent_id": null,
    "child_ids": [],
    "role": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "p1_txt_27",
    "source_text": "Sciences）の附属病院としてモンゴル－日本病院が設立され、臨床、教育、研究が同じ施設内で実施可能な",
    "source_language": "ja",
    "target_language": "vi",
    "content_type": "body",
    "context": "Page 1 PARAGRAPH",
    "location": {
      "page": 1,
      "bbox": [
        45.119998931884766,
        486.8486022949219,
        545.6396484375,
        501.4636535644531
      ]
    },
    "protected_tokens": [],
    "translated_text": "",
    "metadata": {},
    "source_block_id": "p1_txt_27",
    "parent_id": null,
    "child_ids": [],
    "role": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "p1_txt_28",
    "source_text": "状況となった。",
    "source_language": "ja",
    "target_language": "vi",
    "content_type": "body",
    "context": "Page 1 PARAGRAPH",
    "location": {
      "page": 1,
      "bbox": [
        45.119998931884766,
        502.9775695800781,
        121.32096862792969,
        517.201904296875
      ]
    },
    "protected_tokens": [],
    "translated_text": "",
    "metadata": {},
    "source_block_id": "p1_txt_28",
    "parent_id": null,
    "child_ids": [],
    "role": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "p1_txt_29",
    "source_text": "本交流活動では、国立モンゴル医科大学の教員・大学院生と本学の教員・大学院生が共同研究を通じて、",
    "source_language": "ja",
    "target_language": "vi",
    "content_type": "body",
    "context": "Page 1 PARAGRAPH",
    "location": {
      "page": 1,
      "bbox": [
        55.68000411987305,
        520.8086547851562,
        549.5964965820312,
        531.36865234375
      ]
    },
    "protected_tokens": [],
    "translated_text": "",
    "metadata": {},
    "source_block_id": "p1_txt_29",
    "parent_id": null,
    "child_ids": [],
    "role": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "p1_txt_30",
    "source_text": "交流活動を行う。まず、モンゴルの教員・大学院生が、1ケ月間程度、北里大学に短期滞在して、共同研究を",
    "source_language": "ja",
    "target_language": "vi",
    "content_type": "body",
    "context": "Page 1 PARAGRAPH",
    "location": {
      "page": 1,
      "bbox": [
        45.12001037597656,
        536.9384765625,
        550.4400024414062,
        551.162841796875
      ]
    },
    "protected_tokens": [],
    "translated_text": "",
    "metadata": {},
    "source_block_id": "p1_txt_30",
    "parent_id": null,
    "child_ids": [],
    "role": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "p1_txt_31",
    "source_text": "実施するための準備を行う。共同研究の内容について、具体的な計画を策定する。主に動物モデルを用いた",
    "source_language": "ja",
    "target_language": "vi",
    "content_type": "body",
    "context": "Page 1 PARAGRAPH",
    "location": {
      "page": 1,
      "bbox": [
        45.119998931884766,
        556.8125,
        549.491943359375,
        567.3724975585938
      ]
    },
    "protected_tokens": [],
    "translated_text": "",
    "metadata": {},
    "source_block_id": "p1_txt_31",
    "parent_id": null,
    "child_ids": [],
    "role": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "p1_txt_32",
    "source_text": "透析治療に関するもの、また、現地において実施する臨床研究（観察研究）に関するものとなる。日本とモ",
    "source_language": "ja",
    "target_language": "vi",
    "content_type": "body",
    "context": "Page 1 PARAGRAPH",
    "location": {
      "page": 1,
      "bbox": [
        45.1199951171875,
        574.8173217773438,
        549.4813842773438,
        585.3773193359375
      ]
    },
    "protected_tokens": [],
    "translated_text": "",
    "metadata": {},
    "source_block_id": "p1_txt_32",
    "parent_id": null,
    "child_ids": [],
    "role": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "p1_txt_33",
    "source_text": "ンゴルでは、気候や食事内容が異なるなか、血液浄化療法がそれらの環境の違いをどのように受け、最適治",
    "source_language": "ja",
    "target_language": "vi",
    "content_type": "body",
    "context": "Page 1 PARAGRAPH",
    "location": {
      "page": 1,
      "bbox": [
        45.1199951171875,
        592.8220825195312,
        549.484619140625,
        603.382080078125
      ]
    },
    "protected_tokens": [],
    "translated_text": "",
    "metadata": {},
    "source_block_id": "p1_txt_33",
    "parent_id": null,
    "child_ids": [],
    "role": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "p1_txt_34",
    "source_text": "療条件が変化しているのかを明らかにするための研究を実施する。これらの活動には、医療系研究科の大学",
    "source_language": "ja",
    "target_language": "vi",
    "content_type": "body",
    "context": "Page 1 PARAGRAPH",
    "location": {
      "page": 1,
      "bbox": [
        45.120025634765625,
        610.8125,
        549.7196044921875,
        621.3869018554688
      ]
    },
    "protected_tokens": [],
    "translated_text": "",
    "metadata": {},
    "source_block_id": "p1_txt_34",
    "parent_id": null,
    "child_ids": [],
    "role": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "p1_txt_35",
    "source_text": "院生も参画する。その後、日本からモンゴルへ共同研究のために訪問するとともに、国内においても大学院",
    "source_language": "ja",
    "target_language": "vi",
    "content_type": "body",
    "context": "Page 1 PARAGRAPH",
    "location": {
      "page": 1,
      "bbox": [
